'''The People's Voting''' replaced the {{zone|Election Room}} while {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} was mayor. It housed the [[Minister Election]]s, which replaced the [[Mayor Election]] event during {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}}'s mayorship.

== Functions ==
'''The People's Voting''' functioned similarly to the {{zone|Election Room}}. When open, players could enter to vote for the {{Green|7}} [[Minister Election|ministers]] while {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} was mayor. Once the election was over, '''The People's Voting''' closed until the next voting period.

